    "text": "Observed: `finish()` succeeds, but reading the entry fails with `index CRC32 mismatch`. Python\u2019s XZ decoder independently rejects its compressed payload as corrupt. This occurred with locked dependency `lzma-rust2 0.13.0`; nonempty XZ cases passed.\n\n"
  },
  {
